<div class="field field--name-field-news-date field--type-date field--label-hidden"><div class="field__items"><div class="field__item even"><span class="date-display-single" content="2026-08-21T00:00:00-04:00" datatype="xsd:dateTime" property="dc:date">Friday, August 21, 2026</span></div></div></div><div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden"><div class="field__items"><div class="field__item even" property="content:encoded"><p>On August 21, 2026, the Court was notified of a nationwide service disruption that affected the delivery of automated CM/ECF emails, including Notices of Electronic Filing (NEFs) and Notices of Docket Activity. <br/>
Although delayed notices are now beginning to be delivered, users may continue to experience delays.  <br/>
Please be aware of this disruption and contact the Court if you have any questions.  <a href="https://www.med.uscourts.gov">https://www.med.uscourts.gov</a></p>
</div></div></div> </div>]]></content><link href="https://www.med.uscourts.gov/news/cmecf-service-disruption-8212026"/><category term="Federal Maine-Related"/><category term="District Court notices"/><published>2026-08-21T07:16:12+00:00</published></entry></feed>